            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.25.36+LEV.25.37"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lev 25:36-37",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.16.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ma 16:19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.23.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "23:19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Era mu iwe mulimu abagulirirwa okutemula abantu. Mwabaamu abawola banaibwe olw'okubafunaku amagoba olwo beene beeyongere okuba abakombe. Era mwabaamu n'abatoola ebintu bya banaibwe mu kukupankupania. Abantu abo baaneerabira ira.” Musengwa Katonda atyo bw'akoba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kale bona eno, ndikubonereza n'amaani olw'obunhazi bwo n'obutemo bwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Olowooza oti mu biseera bye ndikukangaivuliramu, oliba okaalimu amaani era ng'okaasobola waire okugalula omukono gwo? Nze Musengwa Katonda ninze mwene nkobye, era ekyo ndikikola. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu bo ndibasansaaniza eyo mu maghanga, naabaidhuza eyo mu nsi enhingi, olwo naakumalamu ebikolwa byo ebibi byonabyona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho amaghanga ago galikunhoomoola waawaamu ekitiibwa, era waamanha nga ninze Musengwa Katonda.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabiri Musengwa Katonda yankoba ati: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Iwe omuntu, Abaisiraeli bafuuse iseedha omuzira mugaso. Bafuuse iseedha eriviiremu feeza n'ekyuma eky'ekikomo, n'eibaati, n'ekyuma ekigumu einho, n'ekyuma ekizitogha einho, oluvainhuma lw'okusaanuusibwa n'okukenenulwa mu muliro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho ni, nze Musengwa Katonda kyenva ni mbakoba nti: Olw'okuba boonaboona baafuuka iseedha buseedha, ndibasololeza ghalala mu Yerusalemu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ng'abantu bwe basoloza feeza, n'ekyuma eky'ekikomo, n'ekyuma ekigumu einho, n'ekyuma ekizitogha einho n'eibaati, ni babita mu kyokero ni babisaanuusa. Zeena ntyo bwe ndibasoloza, nga ndiku obusungu n'ekiruyi, naabata agho naabasaanuusa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwenebwene ndibasoloza naabakumaku omuliro ogw'obusungu bwange, baasaanuukira mu Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nga feeza bw'asaanuukira mu kyokero, boona bwe balisaanuukira mu Yerusalemu, memale baamanha nga nze Musengwa Katonda mwene, ninze mbamaliireku obusungu bwange.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
