          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabiri Musengwa Katonda yankoba ati: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Iwe omuntu, kobera Abaisiraeli oti ensi yaibwe ti nongoofu, era ndigibonereza olw'obusungu obundiku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abakulembeze baamu bali ng'oti mpologoma ewologoma, n'ekankanula ky'egemye. Baita abantu, baanhaga empiiya n'eby'obukombe, era baaleka abakazi kamaala nga bafuuse banamwandu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.10.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lev 10:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Bakabona baamu baamenha amateeka gange. Tibaawulagho bintu bitukuvu na bitali bitukuvu, waire okwawulagho ebirongoofu n'ebitali birongoofu. Era tibakuza lunaku lwange lwa Sabbato, baaleetera abantu obutampa kitiisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abakulembeze baamu bali ng'oti misege egikankanula kye gigemye. Baita abantu baabazikiriza, basobole okutwala ebintu byaibwe, bakombaghale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abalanzi baamu baghemba ku bibi ebyo, ng'omuntu bw'asiiga ekimante langi endheru. Okubonekerwa kwe bafuna kwa buguya, ni bye balagula ti bituufu naire, nga bakoba mbu, ‘Musengwa Katonda akoba ati,’ ate nga nze Musengwa Katonda nzira kye nkobye naire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abatyamye b'omu nsi eyo bakola obukupankupania, baanhaga ku bantu ebyaibwe. Banhigiriza abaavu n'abali mu bwetaavu, baakupankupania ebintu by'abasenze aghazira kusaasira naire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nanoonia mu bantu abo aye tyafunamu waire mulala, asobola okuzimba obuyaaka ekimante waire okukuuma mu bifo ekimante ghe kyawomolwa ebituli, asobole okuwonia ensi eyo, ndobe kugizikiriza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 22:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kale ndibamaliraku obusungu bwange, naabazikiriza n'omuliro gw'ekiruyi ekindiku, naabeesasuulizaaku olw'ebyo bye baakola. Nze Musengwa Katonda ninze nkobye.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.22.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.22.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
